# ---- UIEB image data (~1.6 GB, reproducible via scripts/download_uieb.py) ----
# NOTE: UIE-fyp/dataset/mirror_file_listing.json IS tracked (provenance record
# of the mirror's filenames). Only the heavy image subdirectories are ignored.
#
# The `**/` prefix is REQUIRED here: the project lives in the UIE-fyp/
# subdirectory of this repository, and a pattern containing an internal slash
# (e.g. `dataset/raw-890/`) is anchored to the directory holding this file, so
# without `**/` it would match only <root>/dataset/raw-890/ and silently let
# 1.6 GB of images through as untracked.
**/dataset/raw-890/
**/dataset/reference-890/
**/dataset/preprocessed/
**/dataset/challenging-60/
**/dataset/_tmp_uieb/
# U-Net enhanced outputs for the sealed test split (derived images, ~40 MB;
# regenerated by `python -m cnn.enhance --split test`). Sample side-by-side
# figures ARE tracked, under plots/.
**/dataset/enhanced-test/
_uieb_mirror.tar.gz
*.tar.gz

# ---- trained model artifacts (large binaries; checkpoints are not source) ----
**/models/
*.pt
*.pth
*.joblib

# ---- Python ----
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ---- local virtualenvs / editor / OS ----
.venv/
venv/
.idea/
.vscode/
.DS_Store
